  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows a solid cylinder that is rolling down a slope without slipping. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The three forces that act on the cylinder are the weight, the normal force, and the frictional force between the cylinder and the slope. </p>\n<p>Which of these forces provides a torque about the axis of the cylinder?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">The weight</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">The normal force</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">The frictional force</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">None of them</li>\n</ol>"
  },
